WEBVTT

00:13:28.863 --> 00:13:31.727
can put us on the road to a new understanding

00:13:31.727 --> 00:13:33.390
of the universe

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:36.409
or it can send us down a blind alley.

00:13:36.409 --> 00:13:38.973
But whichever it turns out to be,

00:13:38.973 --> 00:13:42.165
there is one thing I'm sure of:

00:13:42.165 --> 00:13:45.514
The journey will be full of surprises.

00:13:45.514 --> 00:13:46.887
Thank you.

00:13:46.887 --> 00:13:52.135
(Applause)